{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"HPP Architekten Website Relaunch","created_at":"2025-01-10T16:18:28.075Z","published_at":"2025-07-15T15:26:53.725Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T15:26:53.745Z","id":607427379,"uuid":"dd1b1b8f-672f-4863-91e9-3952fc685b52","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"3f8384e6-fc83-4ef2-b034-480168480b93","type":"section","style":"","width":"narrow","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"55e71210-21fc-4de8-a699-37ef0fa23e19","text":"Die HPP Architekten GmbH ist ein national und international tätiges Architekturbüro mit Hauptsitz in Düsseldorf. Mit 530 Mitarbeitern an 14 Standorten gehört HPP zu den größten Architekturbüros Deutschlands. In über 80 Jahren hat das Büro tausende von Bauprojekten abgeschlossen.","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"CMS Website Relaunch","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"HPP Architekten","content_gutter":"","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"fc8b3f19-e2ef-47a3-afc3-461ed2f8ae41","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"6153b53e-346b-438c-8be4-8bd1f16d27fe","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"none","textPosition":"center","highlightText":false,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/750x312/d3eaf4df80/hpp_intro-visual-shadowed_mobile.jpg","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x797/1360bb7dd5/hpp_intro-visual-shadowed.jpg","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x797/1360bb7dd5/hpp_intro-visual-shadowed.jpg"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"c4a57774-b411-4a5e-a61b-aed0e2d0c76c","type":"section","style":"","width":"narrow","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"2db3a1d8-17fc-490b-b342-4e484fd5bac8","text":"Um die vielseitigen Leistungen, die Internationalität, den fortschrittlichen Entwurfsplanungsprozess sowie die Arbeitgebermarke von HPP Architekten besser darzustellen, stand das Unternehmen vor der Aufgabe, ihre bisherige Website grundlegend zu überarbeiten. \n\nDie bestehende Online-Präsenz konnte wesentliche Merkmale des Büros nicht angemessen vermitteln: HPP als junges, internationales Architekturbüro in ständiger Weiterentwicklung, die fortschreitende Digitalisierung im Entwurfs- und Planungsprozess sowie die dynamischen und kollaborativen Arbeitsabläufe. Ziel der neuen Website ist es, ein breites Publikum von Interessenten, Projektleitern, Journalisten bis hin zu potenziellen neuen Mitarbeitern anzusprechen und zu überzeugen.","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"Digitale Innovation für architektonische Exzellenz: Eine moderne Weblösung für HPP.","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Die Herausforderung","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"center","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"4ae46334-fe6f-40d1-86c8-6cb228357d38","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"eee98c56-7270-4d57-92a8-6e36187d4e1d","text":"","type":"hero","height":"default","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"none","textPosition":"","highlightText":false,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x854/0257200544/hpp_divider-hero.webp","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x854/0257200544/hpp_divider-hero.webp","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x854/0257200544/hpp_divider-hero.webp"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"29814330-127c-4d51-99d6-668eacb86d9f","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"54bb8233-2952-4202-9fc9-f57944c491df","text":"Für das Projekt wurde eine maßgeschneiderte Lösung entwickelt, die auf einem TYPO3-CMS basiert, um den anspruchsvollen Anforderungen gerecht zu werden. Das durchdachte Design, bereitgestellt vom Partner Radikant, bildete die Grundlage für ein voll responsives Frontend. Dieses sorgt für ein konsistentes Nutzererlebnis auf allen Geräten und Bildschirmgrößen. \n\nZudem wurde ein umfangreiches Digital Asset Management (DAM) System integriert, das eine nahtlose Verwaltung und Bereitstellung von Medieninhalten ermöglicht. So konnten wir eine effiziente und zukunftssichere Weblösung schaffen, die sowohl den ästhetischen als auch den funktionalen Ansprüchen von HPP Architekten gerecht wird.\n\nUm die ständige Entwicklung und Dynamik von HPP wiederzuspiegeln werden auf der Website bestimmte animierte Elemente und Videos verwendet.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Animierte Vorschau, die zeigt, wie der Einsatz von Videos auf der HPP Webseite umgesetzt wurde.","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/840x1440/46ad06207a/mobile-vid.gif","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"7e0ee541-3d41-437a-86c0-9b1ebe1dab10","text":"HPP profitiert nun von einer zukunftssicheren Lösung, die es ihnen ermöglicht, mit den sich ständig ändernden Anforderungen des Marktes Schritt zu halten und gleichzeitig eine konsistente Markenpräsenz aufrechtzuerhalten.\n\n**1 Corporate Website**  \n**1 Universelles DAM**  \n**3 Sprachen**  ","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Outcome","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Verschiedene Screenshots der Dachser Webseite in einem Layout zusammengestellt","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1230x1055/e13f49509f/bild4.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"0476414f-5a89-4d92-8c83-79fe2be94d75","text":"**Industrie & Branche**\n\n- Architektur\n- Corporate\n- Global\n\n--- ","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Design System Services**\n\n- Technische Konzeption \n- CMS Integration\n- Frontend-Entwicklung  \n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- Typo3\n- HTML & CSS, BEM\n- Patternlab\n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default"},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Durch das voll responsive UI & Frontend konnte die UX erheblich verbessert werden, was zu einer höheren Nutzerzufriedenheit und längeren Verweildauern auf der Website führte. \n\nDie Integration des DAM-Systems erleichterte die effiziente Verwaltung und Bereitstellung von Medieninhalten und führte zu optimierten internen Arbeitsabläufen. Insgesamt gelang es durch die neue digitale Präsenz, die Internationalität, Modernität und fortschrittlichen Arbeitsprozesse des Architekturbüros effektiver zu kommunizieren, was das Interesse von potenziellen Kunden, Projektleitern, Journalisten und neuen Talenten steigerte. \n\nSo konnte HPP Architekten seine Marke erfolgreich stärken und seine Position als führendes, innovatives Architektur-Unternehmen weiter festigen.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Exemplarische Vorschau von verschiedenen UI-Komponenten aus dem Dachser Design System","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1202x985/6a1b3c0172/bild16.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"7718811e-a358-484e-aeb6-a8e925f726a3","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"1ca49156-840b-437e-b922-d83b46547d69","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/62e5bb7883/ngo_teaser.png","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/ngo-landing-page-builder","headline":"Landing Page Builder für NGO","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"square","button_label":"Zum Showcase","button_hidden":true,"button_chevron":false},{"_uid":"b7086820-72d6-45b0-8fde-9bbfcc79039f","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/75a4143d37/wolfcraft_teaser_4zu3.jpg","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/wolfcraft-cms-website","headline":"Wolfcraft CMS Website Relaunch","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"square","button_label":"Zum Showcase","button_hidden":true,"button_chevron":false},{"_uid":"85cda0f9-f222-4c19-975c-fdc5921ad90